      "content": "but anchoring just feels like more weight. staying tied to something that doesnt even want me... it just hurts. like im fighting to stay in a place where i dont belong. the drifting... it feels the only thing that actually makes sense. like the only way to find peace is to just let the current take me where it wants.",
